    "body": "The old name was pretty bad, so allow me to bikeshed a little bit. In this context, I'd associate \"on demand\" with a user doing the demanding or perhaps [video on demand](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Video_on_demand) as opposed to live. To call it \"autoplay eligibility flag\" would be an accurate and boring name. That's the best I can come up with, any other ideas?",
